# Stat Min-Maxer Web Worker Rules

* **Zero Main-Thread Blocking:** All armor permutation loops, 0–200 stat tier solving, artifice mod allocations, and fragment stat deltas must run inside a dedicated Web Worker.
* **Typed Worker Protocol:** Define strict discriminated union types (`StatWorkerCommand` / `StatWorkerEvent`) in `src/app/core/models/worker-protocol.model.ts`.
* **Abortable Execution:** Implement request IDs or `AbortController` tokens so stale permutation runs terminate immediately when the user toggles an exotic, stat priority, or activity modifier.
* **Determinism & Tests:** Keep pure stat-scoring functions decoupled from `self.postMessage` so they can be unit-tested synchronously in `*.spec.ts`.
